+f_t(u)+f_t(v)-f_t(u+v)
+\le \min\{f_t(u),f_t(v)\}
+\le
+\min\left\{\sum_{T>t}u_T,\sum_Tv_T\right\}.
+\]
+Consequently
+\[
+B_m(u,v)
+\le
+\sum_{t<m}\min\left\{\sum_{T>t}u_T,\sum_Tv_T\right\}
+\le m\min(\|u\|_1,\|v\|_1).
+\]
