+For the finite-prefix dual functional
+\[
+\Phi(w)=\sum_Tw_TV_T^*
+-\sum_t f_t(w),\qquad
+f_t(w)=\sup_a a\sum_{T>t}w_T1\{a<M_{t,T}\},
