+\[
+D_n(P)=\max_{\lambda\in\Delta_n}
+\left[
+\sum_{T\le n}\lambda_T
+\max_j c_j(L_j(T)-1)_+
+-
+\sum_{t<n}\max_j c_j\Lambda_{N_j(t)}
+\right].
