+\[
+U_t=\lambda\{T:L_\ell(T)>t\},\quad
+W_t=\lambda\{T:L_h(T)>t\}.
+\]
+For any dual law \(\lambda\),
+\[
+\Phi(\lambda)
+=
+\mathbb E_\lambda[(\ell A_T-hB_T)_+]
+-
+\sum_{t<n}(\ell U_t-hW_t)_+.
