+## FA-028: Boundary Defect Implies A Shorter-Prefix Certificate
+
+Refuted in iteration 14. For a dual split \(w=u+v\), the exact identity
+\[
+\Phi(u+v)=\Phi(u)+\Phi(v)+
+\sum_{t<m}\bigl(f_t(u)+f_t(v)-f_t(u+v)\bigr)
